app.vulkan.no_loader = schist: alukho uhlelo lokulayisha i-Vulkan kule sistimu, ngakho akukho okungasetshenziswa ukudweba.\n\nI-Schist iveza izithombe nge-Vulkan, futhi i-`libvulkan.so.1` ayifakiwe.\nKudingeka kokubili uhlelo lokulayisha nesishayeli:\n\n    Arch, CachyOS, Omarchy    sudo pacman -S vulkan-icd-loader vulkan-driver\n    Debian, Ubuntu, Mint      sudo apt install libvulkan1 mesa-vulkan-drivers\n    Fedora, RHEL              sudo dnf install vulkan-loader mesa-vulkan-drivers\n
app.vulkan.override_missing = schist: isishayeli se-Vulkan esiqondiswe yile seshini asikho.\n\nI-{var} isethiwe, futhi ukusetha yona *kuthatha indawo* yokusesha izishayeli\nkohlelo lokulayisha esikhundleni sokwenezela kukho. Ngakho lawa mafayela, angekho,\nawuhlu lonke lwezishayeli — futhi lonke uhlelo lwe-Vulkan kule seshini\naluboni nhlobo isishayeli, kungakhathaliseki ukuthi zingaki ezifakiwe:\n\n{missing}\n    {var}={value}\n\nYiqondise kufayela le-manifest elikhona — izishayeli ezifakiwe zibeka awazo ku-\n/usr/share/vulkan/icd.d — noma uyisuse bese uvumela uhlelo lokulayisha luzitholele.\nIseshini esetha lokhu efayeleni lezilungiselelo (i-`env =` ye-Hyprland,\nifayela le-systemd environment.d, iphrofayela ye-shell) kufanele ilungiswe lapho,\nfuthi ushintsho ludinga ukungena ngemvume kabusha ukuze lufinyelele noma yini esivele isebenza.\n
app.vulkan.override_note = \nI-{var} isethwe ku-{value}, futhi lokho kuthatha indawo yokusesha\nkohlelo lokulayisha: uma kungekho kulawo mafayela e-manifest ahambisana nalo mshini,\nukuyisusa yinto yokuqala okufanele uyizame.\n
app.vulkan.no_driver = schist: asikho isishayeli se-Vulkan esifakiwe, ngakho akukho okungasetshenziswa ukudweba.\n\nI-Schist iveza izithombe nge-Vulkan. Uhlelo lokulayisha lufakiwe kodwa lubika ukuthi asikho\nisishayeli — akukho okubhalise isishayeli kunoma iyiphi indawo kwezimbili okuseshwa kuzo:\n\n{dirs}\n\nUhlelo lokulayisha lufakwa ngokwehlukana nezishayeli, ngakho ngokuvamile lokhu kusho\niphakheji elilodwa elingekho.\n\nFaka isishayeli se-GPU salo mshini:\n\n    Arch, CachyOS, Omarchy    sudo pacman -S vulkan-driver\n    Debian, Ubuntu, Mint      sudo apt install mesa-vulkan-drivers\n    Fedora, RHEL              sudo dnf install mesa-vulkan-drivers\n\nIsishayeli sobunikazi se-NVIDIA sihlanganisa ingxenye yaso ye-Vulkan (`nvidia-utils` ku-Arch,\n`nvidia-driver` ku-Debian). Emshinini obonakalayo, noma kunoma iyiphi indawo engenaso\nisishayeli se-GPU esingafakwa, isivezi sesofthiwe yiso esisebenzayo:\n`vulkan-swrast` ku-Arch, ingxenye ye-`mesa-vulkan-drivers` kwezinye izinhlelo.\nSihamba kancane, kodwa siyaqalisa.\n{overridden}
app.vulkan.no_device = schist: isishayeli se-Vulkan sifakiwe kodwa asinikezi idivayisi okungavezwa ngayo izithombe.\n\nKungenzeka isishayeli singayisekeli le GPU, noma singakwazi ukuyifinyelela —\nnge-SSH, noma ngaphakathi kwekhontena, kuvamile ukuba i-/dev/dri\ningabikho. I-`vulkaninfo --summary` ibika lokho uhlelo lokulayisha olukubonayo.\n\nIsivezi sesofthiwe siveza izithombe ngaphandle kwe-GPU nhlobo, uma kuyisimo\nsalo mshini: i-`vulkan-swrast` ku-Arch, ingxenye ye-`mesa-vulkan-drivers`\nku-Debian naku-Fedora.\n
app.vulkan.skip_hint = Ukuze uqale i-Schist noma kunjalo futhi uyivumele yehluleke ngendlela yayo, setha {var}=1.
